      "final": false,
      "notes": "Areas: brittany_area, anjou_area, poitou_area, orleanais_area. Ownable locations: 101. 1337 start: France owns 35, French subjects 57, others 9. Threshold 94 = +59 over start; weighted effort 61 (subject land x1, foreign land x2; target ~60).\n\nQuest system: evaluated when the mission is taken; a quest whose reward location is not owned drops out; at least half (rounded up) of the remaining quests must be true to take the mission.\nEach TRUE quest: (1) reward location goes up one rank - rural to town, town to city; never megalopolis except Paris; a city gets +5 dev instead. (2) its patron faction +5 disposition, fixed, positive only. (3) its patron faction gains influence in the reward location's province. (4) its bonus becomes an option in the choice event.\nChoice event on completion: one option per TRUE quest. The option gives its country modifier permanently AND spreads the patron faction's influence to half the provinces of that quest's area (rounded up, counting the reward province; most developed first; skips other factions' leader land), via senvm_fof_spread_apply. Disposition and influence apply only while the Fate of France situation is active and the patron faction still exists; the rank-up and the modifier always apply.\nEach TRUE quest also adds 1 to var:senvm_fof_mq_true (read by the final mission).",
