      ],
      "duration_days": 0,
      "final": true,
      "notes": "Reward for final mission scales with var:senvm_fof_mq_true and gives a rewward beased on the strongest faction that is not rebelious or insurectionary\n\nFrance gains diplomatic annexation speed = 1 for 20 years\n\nshown values are for maximum scaling\nConservatives: 7 develelopment in every location in france instantly\nLe Metiers: 15% production effeciency\nCatholic Church. about 35% pop growth over 20 years \nJaqueries: max tax = 0.12\nRepublicans: parliment base support 25, pop promotion speed 30%\nRoyals: maximum control 10\nIndependinists: vassal loyalty 10",
      "manual_index": 0,
      "blocks": {
        "visible": "",
        "enabled": "No faction is rebelious or insurectionary\nor \nfrance owns 80% of france region\n",
        "bypass": "",
        "highlight": "",
        "select_trigger": "",
        "modifier_while_progressing": "",
        "on_start": "",
        "on_completion": "senvm_fof_royaume_complete = yes\n\nEnds the Fate of France situation (listed under its end requirements).\nFrance gains the bonus of the strongest faction (largest share of France) at this moment,\nscaled by var:senvm_fof_mq_true / 19 (true area quests across the tree). Maximum values:\n  gendarmes        army_heavy_cavalry_power = 0.20, nobles_estate_levy_size = 0.50\n  church           global_population_growth = 0.0088 for 30 years (about +30% population)\n  liberals         global_production_efficiency = 0.20\n  republicans      parliament_base_support = 0.20, global_estate_max_tax = 0.10\n  royals           global_crown_estate_power = 0.095, road_cost_on_distance_from_capital = -5\n  independentists  subject_loyalty = 10\n  jacquerie        global_raw_material_output = 0.30, peasants_estate_target_satisfaction = 0.2\n  conservatives    global_max_rural_control = 0.125\nIf the situation already ended: the faction recorded as strongest at its end. None recorded: royals.",
        "on_persistent_completion": "",
        "on_persistent_start": "",
        "on_monthly": ""
      }
    },
