        "modifier_while_progressing": "",
        "on_start": "",
        "on_completion": "REQUIRED\n  La Route d'Ensisheim: Ensisheim\n    Needs: Ensisheim is connected to our capital by road.\n    Gives: +5% maximum control in Ensisheim; +1 maximum artists.\n \nOPTIONAL\n  La Grande Saline: Salins-les-Bains\n    Needs: Salins's salt production at level 5.\n    Gives: +20% salt output in Salins-les-Bains; +1 maximum artists.\n \n  Le Col de Jougne: Pontarlier\n    Needs: a Castle in Pontarlier.\n    Gives: +10% fort defence in Pontarlier; +1 maximum artists.\n \n  Les Châteaux du Sundgau: Ferrette\n    Needs: a Castle in Ferrette and a Castle in Belfort.\n    Gives: +10% fort defence in Ferrette; +1 maximum artists.\n \n  Le Vignoble d'Alsace: Colmar\n    Needs: a Winery in Colmar; Zabern's wine production at level 4.\n    Gives: +20% wine output in Colmar; +1 maximum artists.",
