        "on_start": "",
        "on_completion": "REQUIRED\n  La Route de Luxembourg: Luxembourg\n    Needs: Luxembourg is connected to our capital by road.\n    Gives: Luxembourg's raw material becomes gold.\n \nOPTIONAL\n  Le Charbon du Borinage: Mons\n    Needs: Mons's coal production at level 4.\n    Gives: +20% coal output in Mons.\n \n  Les Armuriers de Liège: Liège\n    Needs: a Weapon Guild in Liège.\n    Gives: +20% weaponry output in Liège.\n \n  Le Fer de Namur: Namur\n    Needs: Namur's iron production at level 4; a Tools Guild in Namur.\n    Gives: +20% iron output in Namur.\n \n  La Calamine du Limbourg: Limbourg\n    Needs: Limbourg's lead production at level 4; Local Smelters in Limbourg.\n    Gives: +20% lead output in Limbourg.\n \n  Le Marbre noir de Dinant: Dinant\n    Needs: Dinant's marble production at level 4; a Mason in Dinant.\n    Gives: +20% marble output in Dinant.",
