    {
      "id": "senvm_fof_amg_1",
      "name": "The Realm of the Knights",
      "desc": "",
      "icon": "mounted_people",
      "group": "group_7",
      "requires": [],
      "duration_days": 0,
      "final": false,
      "notes": "Since the different faction countries dont have to care about the other factions that space should instead be occupied by a mechanic about generating authority \n\nUnlocks realm of knighst mechanic for Anjou in the situation tab\nAnjou Gains 15 monthly manpower for each province that they have \nThey should be able to have a decision that allows them to generate wargoals on other countries. It should cost authority and create ire. Countries they can generate on by order\n- maine MIE (their own vassal)\n- Vendome VDM\n- alencon ALE and their vassal perche PRC\n- Mortain MRT\n- Brittany BRI\nthe normal take land that you have influence in should not be visible for them\n\nadditionally Anjou should be able to start crusasedes.\nHere they should have a Crusader Army Size: [Number] in a large font showing the current size of their crusader army (they start with 5)\nWhen Anjou selects the \"Crusade\" button they first select a muslim country with miniumm 1 coastal location and then a coastal location within that country. The Coastal location must be in europe continent or north africa sub continent or middle east sub continent\n2 months after a country gets selected by anjou they should get an event that they wil be Raided by Anjou and should reduce their opinion of Anjou and then a choice that in 2 months an anjou army will arive on their shores or they pay off anjou with 0.5 a year worth of income. This option should not be picked by ai\nduring that time anjou has a progress bar\nAfter the 4 months anjou declares war on the country and they spawn an army of their custom units equal to the Crusader Army Size variable in the selected location. The created unit should have a unit modifier giving 100% siege ability. The wargoal should not allow transfer of territory or vassalisation and both sides should get blocked_from_peace = yes modifier\n\nThe war should last 2 years and then end \nevery month anjou should get ducats 1 for each 10000 population in locations that they have occupied. theese occupied locations should loose 1 prosperity per month\nFor the duration of the war anjou should have a new progress bar showing the remaing legnth of hte war\nif Anjou wins they increase their Crusade army size by 1\nEither way when the war end anjou looses all armies outside of france region continent and if anjou won Anjou should gain 10 authority and extra up to 20 authority based on teh avera experience_percentage of the army that gets sent away\n3 year cooldown after vicotry 5 after defeat  either way 10 year cooldown per country",
      "manual_index": 3,
      "blocks": {
        "visible": "",
        "enabled": "has researched medival_military",
